  "n": 188,
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "refId": "RV10-188:1",
      "text": "translated by"
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "refId": "RV10-188:2",
      "text": "1. Now send ye Jatavedas forth, send hitherward the vigorous Steed",
      "original": "प्र नूनं जातवेदसमश्वं हिनोत वाजिनम् ।",
      "translit": "pra nūnaṃ jātavedasamaśvaṃ hinota vājinam |"
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "refId": "RV10-188:3",
      "text": "To seat him on our sacred grass.",
      "original": "इदं नो बर्हिरासदे",
      "translit": "idaṃ no barhirāsade"
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "refId": "RV10-188:4",
      "text": "2. I raise the lofty eulogy of Jatavedas, raining boons,",
      "original": "अस्य प्र जातवेदसो विप्रवीरस्य मीळ्हुषः ।",
      "translit": "asya pra jātavedaso vipravīrasya mīḷhuṣaḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "refId": "RV10-188:5",
      "text": "With sages for his hero band.",
      "original": "महीमियर्मि सुष्टुतिम्",
      "translit": "mahīmiyarmi suṣṭutim"
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "refId": "RV10-188:6",
      "text": "3. With flames of Jatavedas which carry oblation to the Gods,",
      "original": "या रुचो जातवेदसो देवत्रा हव्यवाहनीः ।",
      "translit": "yā ruco jātavedaso devatrā havyavāhanīḥ |"
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "refId": "RV10-188:7",
      "text": "May he promote our sacrifice.",
      "original": "ताभिर्नो यज्ञमिन्वतु",
      "translit": "tābhirno yajñaminvatu"
    }
  ]
}
